# This file intentionally lists no addresses yet.
#
# An OWNERS file with only comments does not grant ownership: review falls
# through to the parent //components/OWNERS, which is the honest state while
# the browser, assistant-runtime, and Android owner roles named in the M0
# milestone of docs/roadmap.md are still unfilled. Adding a name here is part
# of closing M0, not something to guess at now.
#
# Security-sensitive surfaces keep an explicit reviewer requirement even
# before then. Both paths below carry the same property: they parse or
# transport data that a compromised renderer controls.
#
# VERIFY AT SP-01: confirm that file:// OWNERS references resolve from an
# overlay-mounted directory (the directory is a symlink into this repository,
# so the OWNERS parser sees it at //taffy/... but the file lives
# outside src/). If symlinked OWNERS files are not resolved, this file has to
# move into the patch queue instead, and that cost belongs in the SP-01
# report.
per-file *.mojom=file://ipc/SECURITY_OWNERS
per-file *_mojom_traits*=file://ipc/SECURITY_OWNERS
